      "body": "## Motivation\n\n`GigaChat35Detector.parse_streaming_increment` has two streaming-only bugs (non-streaming is correct):\n\n1. **Non-contiguous `tool_index`.** The streamed `tool_index` was the raw position of the `<｜GCML｜invoke>` in the region. When an unknown tool is skipped, the next valid call is streamed with `tool_index=1` and no index 0. For the same input, `detect_and_parse` returns index 0.\n2. **`SGLANG_FORWARD_UNKNOWN_TOOLS` ignored.** Non-streaming forwards unknown tools when the env var is set (via `parse_base_json`). Streaming always dropped them.\n\nRepro: `<｜GCML｜tool_calls>` + invoke `nope` + invoke `search` + `</｜GCML｜tool_calls>`, with only `search` defined.\n\n| | before | after |\n|---|---|---|\n| streaming, forward off | `[(1, \"search\")]` | `[(0, \"search\")]` |\n| streaming, forward on | `[(1, \"search\")]` | `[(0, \"nope\"), (1, \"search\")]` |\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `tool_index` now counts the calls actually emitted (`len(self.prev_tool_call_arr)`) instead of invoke positions.\n- Streaming now honors `SGLANG_FORWARD_UNKNOWN_TOOLS`.\n- `prev_tool_call_arr` and `streamed_args_for_tool` are appended to directly, since indices are now contiguous; the pad-with-empty logic is gone.\n- New `test/registered/unit/function_call/test_gigachat35_detector.py` (CPU CI) with two regression tests. This detector had no tests before. Both tests fail on current main.\n\nNote: #45258 (O(N) streaming) edits the same loop but keeps `i = self._emitted_invokes` as the index. Whichever PR lands second needs a small rebase.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nN/A: parser-only change, covered by unit tests.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] `pytest test/registered/unit/function_call` passes (640 passed)\n- [x] pre-commit passes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40302351153](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40302351153)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40302350837](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40302350837)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40302351265](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40302351265)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
